        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "03c1b083-dffb-3feb-a671-eeca44f0dd97",
                "word": "crêperie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c6bf6ec4-0fcc-45b9-b687-009624ba872f",
                        "entry_id": "03c1b083-dffb-3feb-a671-eeca44f0dd97",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "crêperies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce21ce16-5432-3f49-b505-f788c7875bd9",
                        "entry_id": "03c1b083-dffb-3feb-a671-eeca44f0dd97",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Restaurant spécialisé dans la fabrication et la vente de crêpes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "739b482c-ba84-4409-89f7-d4440c51f872",
                                "sense_id": "ce21ce16-5432-3f49-b505-f788c7875bd9",
                                "text": "Et quid de la différence entre crêperie et galetterie, me direz-vous ? A partir du moment où la crêperie sert des galettes et que la galetterie propose des crêpes, la confusion règne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c4ccac2-6a85-477b-b522-4b9a6776af4a",
                                "sense_id": "ce21ce16-5432-3f49-b505-f788c7875bd9",
                                "text": "Dans une crêperie sur les Grands Boulevards, une Espagnole dîne avec un groupe d’amis français."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3ad718c-8827-41ed-9518-ad59579889ce",
                                "sense_id": "ce21ce16-5432-3f49-b505-f788c7875bd9",
                                "text": "Les jours de gros embouteillages car les touristes qui ne trouvaient rien d’autre à faire, se hasardaient en voiture dans des rues qui n’étaient pas faites pour ça, les jours où les crêperies refusaient du monde et où les villes du littoral étaient envahies par des troupes bottées, capelées de cirés comme des terre-neuvas."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5bdc92b3-8f0f-47dd-bb48-a2893e7a8b77",
                        "source_entry_id": "03c1b083-dffb-3feb-a671-eeca44f0dd97",
                        "source_sense_id": "ce21ce16-5432-3f49-b505-f788c7875bd9",
                        "target_lang_word": "crêperie",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "crêperie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13fcc8fe-df62-3ca7-bb7f-df85b1024b0b",
                                        "entry_id": "9c47facb-0c1c-35eb-9fec-9db5a860e9c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of creperie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58e74d18-b387-4834-9126-9b8b3c67e6c0",
                                                "sense_id": "13fcc8fe-df62-3ca7-bb7f-df85b1024b0b",
                                                "text": "It was shortly after my forty-fifth that I stopped in Hampstead to buy, on a whim, a mushroom crêpe from a crêperie stall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "139f75c2-88c9-4be8-8ca5-ccef03a4b2e2",
                                                "sense_id": "13fcc8fe-df62-3ca7-bb7f-df85b1024b0b",
                                                "text": "One of the strongest popularizing forces was Hungarian expatriate Leslie Fono who, with his wife, Paulette, opened one of the first crêperies in San Francisco, the Magic Pan, in 1965."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de61e4cb-4839-4d7e-8156-10940547952d",
                                                "sense_id": "13fcc8fe-df62-3ca7-bb7f-df85b1024b0b",
                                                "text": "The square directly across from Monet’s house, as well as the adjacent street, has many little cafes and crêperies. […] If you’re looking for a light lunch, you’ll enjoy this little crêperie located in a square in the center of town."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb3c3e67-e0f2-436a-8cf0-5174c54ceffc",
                                                "sense_id": "13fcc8fe-df62-3ca7-bb7f-df85b1024b0b",
                                                "text": "There is an art to making a good Breton crêpe which, along with the choice of fillings and decor, is why some crêperies are much better than others. You will find crêperies in every corner of Brittany and they are generally reliably cheap places to eat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0def0951-660f-4496-a878-848e9d8aa96a",
                                                "sense_id": "13fcc8fe-df62-3ca7-bb7f-df85b1024b0b",
                                                "text": "Srdjan Djokovic and his wife, Dijana, both accomplished skiers, gave lessons at the resort and ran three side-by-side businesses in the village: a crêperie, a clothes shop and a pizzeria."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
